{"summary":"Puzzle Game: Gather and Release the Same Birds!","description":"Brain Puzzle Game to Sort Various Birds. Collect the same types of birds to complete puzzles and let the birds fly freely.\n\n[How to Play]\n- Touch the birds to fly them to different branches.\n- Only the bird at the end of the selected branch can be moved.\n- Birds can only be moved if there is space on the target branch.\n- Any bird can be moved to an empty branch.\n- Successfully gather all the same types of birds on each branch.\n- '?' eggs hatch when the birds sitting right in front of them move to another branch.\n- Restart the stage anytime if you get stuck.\n\n[Features]\n- Control with just one finger.\n- No time limits or action points, play anytime, anywhere.\n- Freely change various birds, branches, and background costumes.\n- Use undo and extra branch items to succeed more easily!\n- Compete with other users and climb the rankings to earn additional rewards.\n- Earn gold items in daily quests and infinite competition mode.\n\nHelp : cs@mobirix.com\n\nHomepage :\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4864673505117639552","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C8Aq5TH9tk0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/noNPUxWQ5PkUIeJLXgP2AWb0uChPTirjW-XFtJ2FDV1njkVOuVuOAy_zVmJ--Eg4BTOJ3-CrheONHNqOaDIv1w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Tw9XVibDcXzAjbe2Cg1jkN6JE3TPkApXeg0rbwl4FMSUjjJZa7Hls_HTSgOfeDZ2VZQchvfrSAWGVtQINDszdQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7dz6t-LcfaHhJU3ye7uiHkG-57p-tjCyJW3-Iyb4nOvvj0tEjBiS2yJaQpfVMNPcJGMjwGKpLZXwWsvTyAUOrQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/A-yQH8yz-TxDFTX4J-UjhnmpnZM0igpNSx60UAmrj8eZrhmSn2jKNANsrWZzQU7C_1xQLarfN0q0RtRPmvR7kg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7903FnEZSg6EdQODs9gQnjwAKuImSnXAGB53EZtHDTRCpp_C-wj2cSiu0E_yfSRDZiIGeEGVN3_5qVHvip19","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LDDT4DHmN58X-